``` LF-05 | Host and Source Missing From License Usage (Squashing)
    Splunk Administrator Field Manual - Gaurav Malik

    Use case: License usage reports show large volumes with an empty host or
    source; recover per-host and per-source attribution when license_usage.log
    has squashed those values.
    Run on: SH.
    Query: Fallback attribution from indexer throughput metrics (SH)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/LF-05-probe.spl to confirm the data it
    reads exists here.
```
index=_internal source=*metrics.log group=per_host_thruput earliest=-1d@d latest=@d
| stats sum(kb) as kb by series
| eval gb=round(kb / 1024 / 1024, 2)
| rename series as host
| sort - kb
| head 25
